    {
      "title": "Short-term vs Long-term Memory",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Short-term vs Long-term Memory",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Two Memories",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Short-term",
                "Long-term"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Is",
                  "==Context window==",
                  "External store: vector DB, KV, files"
                ],
                [
                  "Holds",
                  "Messages, tool calls, results",
                  "Facts, preferences, outcomes"
                ],
                [
                  "Lifetime",
                  "{red:Lost} at session end",
                  "{green:Persists} across sessions"
                ],
                [
                  "Access",
                  "Size-limited",
                  "Similarity or key lookup"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Stay Within Budget",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "cards",
              "spec": {
                "cards": [
                  {
                    "title": "Sliding window",
                    "lines": [
                      "Keep recent turns"
                    ],
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Summarize",
                    "lines": [
                      "Compress old turns"
                    ],
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "title": "Trim",
                    "lines": [
                      "Cut bulky tool outputs"
                    ],
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Long-term Write Policy",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Write ==distilled facts==: preferences, decisions, outcomes",
                "{red:Never} raw transcripts",
                "Read: retrieve ==top-k== relevant items, inject into the prompt"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "chain",
              "spec": {
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "text": "Query",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Search store",
                    "note": "similarity or key",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Top-k",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Prompt",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistake",
              "text": "Storing raw transcripts bloats the store and buries useful facts."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Storage and lifetime?** Context window, gone at session end, vs an external store that persists.",
                "**Window full?** Slide the window, summarize old turns, trim tool outputs.",
                "**What to write, how to read?** Distilled facts; retrieve top-k by similarity or key."
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
